{"entries":[[5473,"inhabituel","adjective",3,"/i.na.bi.tɥɛl/","","",[["unusual, uncustomary, unhabitual","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"inhabituel","feminine":"inhabituelle","masculine_plural":"inhabituels","feminine_plural":"inhabituelles"},[],""],[6392,"inhumain","adjective",3,"/i.ny.mɛ̃/","","",[["inhumane","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"inhumain","feminine":"inhumaine","masculine_plural":"inhumains","feminine_plural":"inhumaines"},[],["Il lui fit subir un traitement inhumain.","Il s'est montré inhumain envers ces malheureux.","Il y avait dans ce pays une loi inhumaine, une coutume inhumaine."]],[12073,"inhabité","adjective",2,"/i.na.bi.te/","","",[["uninhabited","",[],[],[]],["unoccupied","",[],[],[]],["unmanned","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"inhabité","feminine":"inhabitée","masculine_plural":"inhabités","feminine_plural":"inhabitées"},[],["Peu de villages. Quelques rares masures dont la plupart sont inhabitées.","Les îles Galapagos, autrefois inhabitées, n'étaient alors visitées que par quelques baleiniers qui venaient s'y ravitailler en eau.","Aux aventureux, l'Islande offre aussi l'attrait de l'inconnu. Le cœur de l'île, inhabité et inhabitable, est encore une terre incognito."]],[14417,"inhumer","verb",2,"/i.ny.me/","",[11689,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-inhumer.wav.mp3"],[["to bury; to inter","",[],["enterrer","mettre en terre"],[]]],{"infinitive":"inhumer","auxiliary":"avoir","present_participle":"inhumant","past_participle":"inhumé","present":["inhume","inhumes","inhume","inhumons","inhumez","inhument"],"imperfect":["inhumais","inhumais","inhumait","inhumions","inhumiez","inhumaient"],"future":["inhumerai","inhumeras","inhumera","inhumerons","inhumerez","inhumeront"],"conditional":["inhumerais","inhumerais","inhumerait","inhumerions","inhumeriez","inhumeraient"],"subjunctive":["inhume","inhumes","inhume","inhumions","inhumiez","inhument"]},[],["Il a été inhumé parmi les braves défenseurs de l'islam (que Mahomet protège !), aux pieds du Kizil-Tépé, dans les plaines de Karadjémir,","Décédé à Paris le 11 novembre 1872, des suites d'une albuminurie, son corps a été transporté le soir même pour être inhumé dans un caveau de famille, à Sedan."]],[15035,"inhibition","noun",2,"/i.ni.bi.sjɔ̃/","f",[12145,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-inhibition.wav.mp3"],[["inhibition","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"inhibitions"},[],["L'arrêt, l'ordonnance portait inhibitions et défenses.","Inhibitions et défenses sont faites à toutes personnes.","Il fallait songer à la possibilité de cette mort par inhibition."]],[15417,"inhérent","adjective",2,"/i.ne.ʁɑ̃/","","",[["inherent","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"inhérent","feminine":"inhérente","masculine_plural":"inhérents","feminine_plural":"inhérentes"},[],["Son grand corps est long, encore mince bien que la sédentarité inhérente à son métier l'ait quelque peu empâté.","Pour ne pas se griser, malgré les nombreuses libations inhérentes à des fêtes de ce genre, on garnissait de lierre, bouteilles, lampes et meubles !"]],[18557,"inhabitable","adjective",2,"/i.na.bi.tabl/","","",[["uninhabitable","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"inhabitable","masculine_plural":"inhabitables"},[],["Aux aventureux, l'Islande offre aussi l'attrait de l'inconnu. Le cœur de l'île, inhabité et inhabitable, est encore une terre incognita."]],[18662,"inhumation","noun",2,"/i.ny.ma.sjɔ̃/","f",[14944,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-inhumation.wav.mp3"],[["inhumation","",[],["mise en terre"],[]]],{"plural":"inhumations"},[],["Dans la même tombe, les deux modes de sépulture sont représentés, l'inhumation et la crémation."]],[20134,"inhospitalier","adjective",2,"/i.nɔs.pi.ta.lje/","",[16141,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-inhospitalier.wav.mp3"],[["inhospitable","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"inhospitalier","feminine":"inhospitalière","masculine_plural":"inhospitaliers","feminine_plural":"inhospitalières"},[],["Irrité de ces préparatifs de la part de l'ermite, lesquels avaient évidemment pour objet d'appuyer ses intentions inhospitalières, le chevalier frappa la porte."]],[20279,"inhaler","verb",2,"/i.na.le/","",[16256,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-inhaler.wav.mp3"],[["to inhale","",[],[],[]]],{"infinitive":"inhaler","auxiliary":"avoir","present_participle":"inhalant","past_participle":"inhalé","present":["inhale","inhales","inhale","inhalons","inhalez","inhalent"],"imperfect":["inhalais","inhalais","inhalait","inhalions","inhaliez","inhalaient"],"future":["inhalerai","inhaleras","inhalera","inhalerons","inhalerez","inhaleront"],"conditional":["inhalerais","inhalerais","inhalerait","inhalerions","inhaleriez","inhaleraient"],"subjunctive":["inhale","inhales","inhale","inhalions","inhaliez","inhalent"]},[],["Inhaler des vapeurs d'eucalyptus.","Inhaler la fumée d'une cigarette. — Inhaler des vapeurs toxiques."]],[20465,"inhalateur","noun",2,"/i.na.la.tœʁ/","m",[16418,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-inhalateur.wav.mp3"],[["inhaler","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"inhalateurs"},[],["Si vous devez renouveler les inhalations, procurez-vous un inhalateur en pharmacie."]],[21180,"inhalation","noun",2,"/i.na.la.sjɔ̃/","f",[17025,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-inhalation.wav.mp3"],[["inhalation (all meanings)","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"inhalations"},[],["Surveillez toujours un enfant ou une personne âgée en inhalation : la respiration doit être facilitée, l'inhalation agréable."]],[21181,"inhiber","verb",2,"/i.ni.be/","",[17026,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-inhiber.wav.mp3"],[["to inhibit (to hinder; to restrain)","",[],[],[]]],{"infinitive":"inhiber","auxiliary":"avoir","present_participle":"inhibant","past_participle":"inhibé","present":["inhibe","inhibes","inhibe","inhibons","inhibez","inhibent"],"imperfect":["inhibais","inhibais","inhibait","inhibions","inhibiez","inhibaient"],"future":["inhiberai","inhiberas","inhibera","inhiberons","inhiberez","inhiberont"],"conditional":["inhiberais","inhiberais","inhiberait","inhiberions","inhiberiez","inhiberaient"],"subjunctive":["inhibe","inhibes","inhibe","inhibions","inhibiez","inhibent"]},[],["L'odorat, qui a pour siège les poils olfactifs est, chez lui, rudimentaire, et partiellement inhibé par la vision."]],[21877,"inhumanité","noun",1,"/i.ny.ma.ni.te/","f",[17603,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-inhumanit%C3%A9.wav.mp3"],[["inhumanity","",[],[],[]],["barbarity","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"inhumanités"},[],["Il l'a traité avec inhumanité.","Exercer de grandes inhumanités.","Acte d'inhumanité envers des vaincus."]],[22668,"inhibiteur","noun",1,"/i.ni.bi.tœʁ/","m",[18263,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-inhibiteur.wav.mp3"],[["inhibitor","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"inhibiteurs"},[],["Les inhibiteurs de métalloprotéases matricielles possèdent un potentiel thérapeutique dans la lutte contre l'invasion métastasique."]],[27336,"inhumainement","adverb",1,"/i.ny.mɛn.mɑ̃/","",[22151,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-inhumainement.wav.mp3"],[["inhumanely","",[],[],[]]],{},[],["Quand j'aurais de ma main fait périr votre amant, Pourriez-vous me traiter plus inhumainement ?","À l'égard des Moscovites, ils demandèrent la vie à genoux, mais on les massacra inhumainement plus de six heures après le combat."]],[28003,"inhabituellement","adverb",1,"/i.na.bi.tɥɛl.mɑ̃/","",[22676,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-inhabituellement.wav.mp3"],[["unusually (not according to routine or tradition)","",[],[],[]]],{},[],""],[31170,"inhabile","adjective",1,"/i.na.bil/","",[25207,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-inhabile.wav.mp3"],[["unskilful; maladroit","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"inhabile","masculine_plural":"inhabiles"},[],["Puis la gravure de cette dalle, l'inscription, sont tracées par un faussaire ignorant et inhabile.","Il m'avait même parlé du fameux bouquet qu'avait ramassé, au grand désespoir de l'inhabile viseuse, le machiniste.","Libre à d'autres de rire d'une lenteur apparente, d'une hésitation qui est scrupule, d'une méthode qu'on croit inhabile."]],[36976,"inharmonieux","adjective",1,"","","",[["inharmonious","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"inharmonieux","feminine":"inharmonieuse","mas